{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And HaShem saved on that day.</b> To fulfill what was said: ״Stand and see the salvation of HaShem which He will do for you today.״ And on that day the salvation was complete, for from there onward they did not see them. <b>Egypt dead.</b> Scripture calls them in the singular, like ״and behold, Egypt traveling after them.״" "<b>On the shore of the sea.</b> It is the way of the sea to cast its carcasses onto its shore, as it is written: ״and its waters cast up mud and clay.״ And some emend the verse <b>and Israel saw</b> — that they were on the shore of the sea — [as:] Egypt dead and drowning."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:55.131047455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}